  "prefLabel": "Ed 1124.01 Disciplinary Procedures",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Ed 1124.01 Disciplinary Procedures. Each LEA shall develop disciplinary procedures, including, but not limited to, suspension , expulsion, manifestation determination, appeals, placement, protection, and referral for children with disabilities, consistent with the provisions of 34 CFR 300.530 - 300.536.\n\nSource. (see Revision Note at chapter heading for Ed 1100) #9197, eff 6-28-08; ss by #12141, eff 3-24-17",
